flowchart TD
    P[Procrastination] --> C[Cue]
    P --> R[Reward]
    P --> H[Habit Loop]

    C --> C1[Trigger - e.g. open phone]
    C --> C2[Focus on discomfort]

    R --> R1[Temporary Relief]
    R --> R2[Short-Term Dopamine]

    H --> H1[Cue -> Routine -> Reward]
    H --> H2[Reinforced over time]

    S[Defeating Procrastination] --> T[Pomodoro]
    S --> DW[Deep Work]
    S --> E[Environment Design]

    T --> T1[25 min / 5 min]
    T --> T2[Builds Focus Muscle]

    DW --> DW1[Distraction-Free Blocks]
    DW --> DW2[Flow State]

    E --> E1[Remove Phone / Notifications]
    E --> E2[Dedicated Workspace]
    E --> E3[Batch Similar Tasks]
